OL,3,GNEWSAMum's 30-week wait for son's
OL,4,Aspecial needs plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose autistic son waited more
OL,7,Fthan 30 weeks for an Education, Health
OL,8,Fand Care Plan (EHCP) says she is not
OL,9,Fsurprised Warwickshire County Council
OL,10,Fis missing legal deadlines for children
OL,11,Fwith special educational needs.
OL,13,FData due before the authority's cabinet
OL,14,Fshowed just 9.2% of EHCP applications
OL,15,Fwere completed within the statutory
OL,16,F20-week timeframe in June.
OL,18,FThe council's director for children and
OL,19,Fyoung people, John Coleman, described
OL,20,Fthe position as "a major concern and
OL,21,Funacceptable", citing rising demand and
OL,22,Fcapacity pressures.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
